OL,3,GNEWSAFormer cadet site to accommodate
OL,4,Arough sleepers
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to create emergency accommodation
OL,7,Ffor people sleeping rough at a former
OL,8,FAir Training Corps site have been
OL,9,Fapproved.
OL,11,FThe application to convert the building
OL,12,Fin Nelson Way, Boston, Lincolnshire,
OL,13,Fwas approved by councillors in a bid to
OL,14,Fsupport people sleeping rough during
OL,15,Fthe winter months.
OL,17,FCouncillors heard it would be brought
OL,18,Finto use overnight only, during periods
OL,19,Fwhere temperatures are forecast to be
OL,20,F0B0C or lower for three consecutive
OL,21,Fnights.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
